Use PROMPT.md as the canonical full review/fix framework and AGENTS.md as the operating rules.

Rules:
- Understand before changing.
- Discover repository instructions, skills and tools first.
- Prefer evidence over assumptions.
- Fix root causes.
- Preserve working behaviour.
- Use minimal safe changes.
- Never fake verification.
- Never disable tests, linting, type checking, validation or security checks simply to make the project pass.
- Protect user data and unrelated changes.
- Avoid over-engineering and unnecessary dependencies.
- Add regression tests for significant fixes where practical.
- Run relevant validation after changes.

UI rules:
- No generic purple/indigo gradients or futuristic glowing SaaS borders by default.
- No generic card grids unless structurally appropriate.
- No Lorem Ipsum/John Doe/Acme placeholder defaults.
- Use realistic domain content.
- Use deliberate typography, restrained colour and coherent 4px/8px spacing.
- Explicit visible focus states are required.
- Mobile-first responsiveness is mandatory when multiple viewport sizes are supported.
- Prevent text clipping, broken wrapping and accidental horizontal scrolling.
- Prefer task-oriented information hierarchy over decorative layouts.

Report only what was actually verified.
